35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Only two firms are bidding. They warn of clay and slippage.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, that aligns with my findings. The ground is tricky.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The staff roll is down to seven. But volunteers help on weekends.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The old basin is fine, but the civic hall apron is failing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,Planted ground costs triple to maintain. The fund won't cover surfacing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"The south can be hoarded, but the centre cannot.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
