43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, yes. The planting died because aftercare was ignored.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If we choose water, the fund pays for it, but upkeep is high.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We must be careful with the earth-moving. It is risky.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The heat is rising. We need shade and water management.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I feel the volunteers are a good support, but not enough alone.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,We cannot repeat the mistake of ignoring aftercare for the trees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The financial gap is widening. We must be realistic about costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I think we need a plan that works with the clay, not against it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The drainage issues are critical.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am still worried about who does the daily work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,"We must judge by what survives, not what looks good on day one.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will support the option that balances cost and durability.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
